  "description": "Once upon a time, there was a young woman who had to make a journey. As she was walking alone through a dangerous forest, she came upon a werewolf. Alex is used to his life of seclusion. The forest he lives in may be dangerous, but considering the fact that he is one of the things that makes it so dangerous, he’s doing just fine on his own. Or at least he was, until the day he rescued a young woman in a red hood… \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
